Diver downloads this dataset separately and does not bundle it in its upload package.
The local cached adaptation normalizes domain names, omits IP/unrecognized hostname
entries and a limited set of shared-service hostnames, deduplicates entries, and
performs exact hostname matching. Adapted dataset entries retain CC BY-SA 4.0.
This dataset license applies to the dataset, separately from Diver's own code.
